Z||000008||thomas_l||10-08-2001||10:56 AM||||It's not a Toyota, but the '02 Chevy Siverado I just bought gets the same job done. 5.3L Vortec 285hp pulls 4700lb (including my 200+ lb ass behind the wheel) right past some surprised "challengers". Of course when I do that I can see the gas gauge dropping  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Prior to buying the Chevy, I had borrowed a friend's Tundra to haul a lawn tractor. Pretty impressive. I was expecting the "tin-can" feel of the old T-100 but the Tundra was definitely a better truck.||||reg||10
